      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽数码不求从任何人那里获得回报。\n既然如此，就维持现状或许会比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ee31a975bdd4b886e76377234285c1f1b28b964fa58b94b2cb168c6511a7fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
